Throne & Liberty Predator Build Optimization

Objective

Investigate the trade-off between poison-based gameplay and sustained pressure gameplay.

Hypothesis

Traditional builds overinvest in poison mechanics.

Testing Areas

Damage consistency
Resource management
Skill synergy
Rotation complexity
Build accessibility

Key Finding

Players often achieve greater consistency through sustained-pressure gameplay loops than highly specialized poison rotations.

Skills Demonstrated

Combat Design
Balance Analysis
Player Decision Making
Gameplay Flow

